                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A turn starts while the starship doesn't have any remaining Shield Points</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The starship is in a vacuum, and the inside of the starship isn't a vacuum</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Air rapidly escapes through the breach. The hazardous fills every space within 10 feet of its current space, unless those spaces are blocked by an airlock or a similarly strong and airtight barrier. The trap then rolls initiative.</p>"
                },
