            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Pull Into Space",
            "sort": 0,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Creatures in the spaces of hazardous airflow must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:20] save. On a failure, a creature is pulled 15 feet toward the hull breach along the shortest possible path (30 feet on critical failure). Untethered Large or smaller objects are also pulled and automatically fail. Creatures and objects pulled through the hull breach float into space. If they're untethered, they move away from the starship's zone, opposite of its heading, at a rate of 1 zone per minute.</p>"
                },
